sequenceDiagram
    %% saving an engram from the Fluid editor; the edit never touches a %% comment
    actor person as Person
    participant editor as Editor
    participant rest as REST API
    participant engine as Engine
    person->>editor: stops typing
    editor->>editor: debounce
    editor->>rest: PUT engram, if the revision is still 7
    alt revision matches
        rest->>engine: write
        engine-->>rest: revision 8
        rest-->>editor: 200
    else someone else saved
        rest-->>editor: 409 with their text
        editor->>person: Show the two versions
    end
